{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"asphaltic-burgundy-viper","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Observed signal\nError sweep window 2026-08-30T21:20:00-07:00..2026-09-01T11:58:00-07:00 (2026-08-31T04:20:00Z..2026-09-01T18:58:00Z) found GitHub Actions run 33455923923 (`Jira DC Exact-Patchset Parity`, workflow_dispatch, triggered by JoeOakhartNava) failed before executing the live DC parity body.\n\nFailing job: `jira DC exact-patchset parity (real Jira Data Center, ephemeral)` at step `Verify the checkout landed on the exact patchset SHA`.\n\nError:\n`checked-out HEAD (d6c37680805fc8ae013832dd4c09c1fb100a1e0b) does not match the requested Gerrit patchset revision (a22257e7d10e3d079ee676cbb38d2b39811d0fd5) — refusing to run the DC lane against the wrong ref.`\n\n## Root-cause direction\nThis is workflow/checkout plumbing, not a Jira DC application failure: the exact-patchset workflow carried expected patchset SHA `a22257e7d10e3d079ee676cbb38d2b39811d0fd5`, but the checkout action left the workspace at `d6c37680805fc8ae013832dd4c09c1fb100a1e0b`. The guard correctly failed closed, but the workflow cannot currently provide parity evidence for the requested patchset.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- The Jira DC exact-patchset parity workflow checks out the exact requested Gerrit patchset SHA before any live DC operation runs.\n- If the requested patchset cannot be fetched, the workflow fails with a clear fetch/input error rather than landing on a different commit.\n- A rerun or equivalent dispatch for the affected patchset reaches the DC parity checks with `HEAD == expected_sha`.","id":"897e-8ad4-0444-49d9","parent_id":"","priority":3,"tags":[],"ticket_type":"bug","title":"[ci] Jira DC exact-patchset parity aborts after checking out the wrong patchset SHA"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1788294772433754001,"uuid":"228f4f7e-f959-4e59-ae59-e51fa3e2e675"}